status effects</strong>, there’s a Creo to match every strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317290/extras/9538fabf7fc6db979fab5d5092df8a87.poster.avif?t=1787073313\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317290/extras/9538fabf7fc6db979fab5d5092df8a87.webm?t=1787073313\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317290/extras/9538fabf7fc6db979fab5d5092df8a87.mp4?t=1787073313\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317290/extras/75a10f09101271169512832290cf1ec5.apng?t=1787073313\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317290/extras/75a10f09101271169512832290cf1ec5.poster.avif?t=1787073313\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience over <strong>30 hours</strong> of offline gameplay in a stunningly crafted pixel-art world. Step into hidden caves, walk through bustling cities, or tiptoe through active volcanoes. Witness all of Shoru’s lively biomes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317290/extras/9e26516b3f41c8edccab9526aee72de1.poster.avif?t=1787073313\" width=640 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317290/extras/9e26516b3f41c8edccab9526aee72de1.webm?t=1787073313\" type