kamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317290/extras/c67675662444a03054e72ff8d853f1f5.mp4?t=1787073313\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317290/extras/becb08868ae17b6d4f0b055360e95768.apng?t=1787073313\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317290/extras/becb08868ae17b6d4f0b055360e95768.poster.avif?t=1787073313\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle fellow cadets across the globe in <strong>Online Ranked Battles</strong>, or <strong>challenge your friends</strong> in casual matches. Prefer a solo experience? <strong>You can enjoy the full adventure completely offline.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317290/extras/0bf305f21abf8fd44cbb217ee403f178.apng?t=1787073313\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317290/extras/0bf305f21abf8fd44cbb217ee403f178.poster.avif?t=1787073313\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge powerful Evokers across Shoru’s many locales and rise to the top to <strong>conquer the Coliseum</strong>. Only the best of the best can earn the coveted title of <strong>Evoking Master</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317290/extras/a1a2c73abd183b901689e971a5bfc028.poster.avif?t=1787073313\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.stea